a beer from the fridge.

00:04:22.467 --> 00:04:24.133
You can chug it, if you'd like.

00:04:24.133 --> 00:04:26.534
[ Laughter ]
And then he's going to take it
to the trash can for you.

00:04:26.534 --> 00:04:29.367
-Oh, and recycle.
Thank you so much, Kevin Bacon.

00:04:29.367 --> 00:04:30.734
Kevin Bacon, this is fantastic.

00:04:30.734 --> 00:04:32.334
