when he brings it to you.

00:04:34.167 --> 00:04:35.434
-Sure.
-Pretty simple.

00:04:35.434 --> 00:04:37.000
-Yeah, no problem.
-Alright. Can you maybe open?

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.868
Look. Open.

00:04:38.868 --> 00:04:40.567
Good. Go take.
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:04:40.567 --> 00:04:41.667
Good. Bring it.
Give it to him.

00:04:41.667 --> 00:04:42.868
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:42.868 --> 00:04:44.534
Thank you, Kevin.
-Hey, buddy.

00:04:44.534 --> 00:04:47.033
