00:04:50.501 --> 00:04:52.300
I'm done with this beer.
-Hey, trash can.

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:54.400
Please put it in.

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.300
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Yeah!

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:57.534
That's the best!

00:04:57.534 --> 00:05:00.234
Kevin Bacon! Come on, bud. Oh!
-Yeah!

00:05:00.234 --> 00:05:01.934
-That's the best!

00:05:01.934 --> 00:05:03.300
-Good job.
-That's what I'm talking about.

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:05.868
Great job, Kevin Bacon.
Great job to all of our dogs.

00:05:05.868 --> 00:05:09.267
If you have a dog
with a fun talent, go to...

00:05:10.467 --> 00:05:11.734
Stick around.
We'll be right back

00:05:11.734 --> 00:05:13.400
